UPDATE public.economics_cases SET tactical_explanations = ARRAY['TRUE — On the Fuhrmann definition used in the entrance exam, the sentence is correct. The balance sheet of a courier firm shows its assets, equity and liabilities on one specific date, while its statement of profit and loss reports the revenue earned and costs incurred across the whole accounting period.

